{"parse":{"title":"Ember Charge","pageid":8906,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox-root\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Ember Charge</div><div class=\"infobox-image-container\"><div class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Ember_Charge.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/Ember_Charge.png?c3bca\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"infobox-image-caption\"><i>Trapped embers, ready to burst. Caution is advised.</i></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Internal ID</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nBombDynamite</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nBomb</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Source</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<a href=\"/w/Workbench\" title=\"Workbench\">Workbench</a></div></div><div id=\"tabber-67cdb4b63c9761e81c6af9d51ed2eab2\" class=\"tabber\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tabbertab\" data-title=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"infobox-tab\"><div class=\"infobox-group\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-group\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Wielding</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nOne-handed</div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-group horizontal\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Weight</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n0.3</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Stack</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n50</div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-group horizontal\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Crafting level</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span style=\"color: var(--theme-alert-color)\">1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-group\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Crafting materials</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<p>Crafts 10 \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Seal_Pelt\" title=\"Seal Pelt\">Seal Pelt</a> x2</li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Embers\" title=\"Embers\">Embers</a> x1</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-group\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Primary attack</div><div class=\"infobox-group horizontal\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><a href=\"/w/Damage_types#Blunt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">Blunt</a></div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n140</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><a href=\"/w/Damage_types#Chop\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">Chop</a></div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n100</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><a href=\"/w/Damage_types#Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">Pickaxe</a></div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n50</div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-group horizontal\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><a href=\"/w/Stagger\" title=\"Stagger\">Stagger</a></div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n140</div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-group horizontal\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Stamina</div>\n<div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n8</div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\t\t\t</div></div><pre class=\"infobox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#123;&#34;description&#34;:&#34;Trapped embers, ready to burst. Caution is advised.&#34;,&#34;materials 1&#34;:&#34;* &#91;&#91;Seal Pelt&#93;&#93; x2\\n* &#91;&#91;Embers&#93;&#93; x1&#34;,&#34;tool tier&#34;:&#34;6&#34;,&#34;image&#34;:&#34;Ember Charge.png&#34;,&#34;crafting level&#34;:&#34;1&#34;,&#34;type&#34;:&#34;Bomb&#34;,&#34;wiki&#34;:&#34;Valheim&#34;,&#34;id&#34;:&#34;BombDynamite&#34;,&#34;source&#34;:&#34;&#91;&#91;Workbench&#93;&#93;&#34;,&#34;pickaxe&#34;:&#34;50&#34;,&#34;pageName&#34;:&#34;Ember Charge&#34;,&#34;isContentPage&#34;:true,&#34;quantity&#34;:&#34;10&#34;,&#34;title&#34;:&#34;Ember Charge&#34;,&#34;chop&#34;:&#34;100&#34;,&#34;stamina&#34;:&#34;8&#34;,&#34;wielding&#34;:&#34;One-handed&#34;,&#34;weight&#34;:&#34;0.3&#34;,&#34;blunt&#34;:&#34;140&#34;&#125;</pre></div>\n<p><b>Ember Charges</b> are <a href=\"/w/Deep_North\" title=\"Deep North\">Deep North</a>-tier <a href=\"/w/Bombs\" title=\"Bombs\">Bombs</a>. They deals 140 <a href=\"/w/Blunt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blunt\">Blunt</a>, 100 <a href=\"/w/Chop\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chop\">Chop</a> and 50 <a href=\"/w/Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pickaxe\">Pickaxe</a> damage in a 3 meters radius.\n</p><p>Notably, Ember Charges has enough <a href=\"/w/Tool_tier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tool tier\">tool tier</a> to blow up <a href=\"/w/Petrified_Gammeltroll\" title=\"Petrified Gammeltroll\">Petrified Gammeltrolls</a> in order to obtain <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Petrified_Tissue\" title=\"Petrified Tissue\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Petrified_Tissue.png/30px-Petrified_Tissue.png?9b68a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Petrified_Tissue.png/60px-Petrified_Tissue.png?9b68a 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Petrified_Tissue\" title=\"Petrified Tissue\">Petrified Tissue</a>, which can be smelted into <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Bloodgold\" title=\"Bloodgold\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Bloodgold.png/30px-Bloodgold.png?04132\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bloodgold.png/60px-Bloodgold.png?04132 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Bloodgold\" title=\"Bloodgold\">Bloodgold</a>.\n</p><p>Ember Charges also deal 1 Chop and 1 Pickaxe damage on a direct hit.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Recipe\">Recipe</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ember_Charge?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Recipe\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ember_Charge?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Recipe\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>10 Embers charges can be crafted at a level 1 <a href=\"/w/Workbench\" title=\"Workbench\">Workbench</a> with:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Seal_Pelt\" title=\"Seal Pelt\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Seal_Pelt.png/30px-Seal_Pelt.png?47a9d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Seal_Pelt.png/60px-Seal_Pelt.png?47a9d 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Seal_Pelt\" title=\"Seal Pelt\">Seal Pelt</a> x2</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Embers\" title=\"Embers\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Embers.png/30px-Embers.png?2a514\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Embers.png/60px-Embers.png?2a514 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Embers\" title=\"Embers\">Embers</a> x1</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Availability\">Availability</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ember_Charge?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Availability\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ember_Charge?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Availability\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Embers\" title=\"Embers\">Embers</a> are acquired from an <a href=\"/w/Eternal_Pyre\" title=\"Eternal Pyre\">Eternal Pyre</a>, which can only be built after <a href=\"/w/Fader\" title=\"Fader\">Fader</a> is defeated.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Seal_Pelt\" title=\"Seal Pelt\">Seal Pelts</a> are dropped by <a href=\"/w/Seal\" title=\"Seal\">Seals</a> found at the shore of the <a href=\"/w/Deep_North\" title=\"Deep North\">Deep North</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tips\">Tips</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ember_Charge?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Tips\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ember_Charge?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Tips\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Ember Charges are not limited to mine Petrified Gammeltroll, they can be used to quickly mine or chop all the resources of the game.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Show\" data-collapsetext=\"Hide\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-title\"><th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\"><span class=\"navbox-vde\"><a href=\"/w/Template:WeaponsNav\" title=\"Template:WeaponsNav\"><span title=\"View this navbox template\">v</span></a> · <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Template_talk:WeaponsNav\"><span title=\"Discuss this navbox template\">d</span></a> · <a class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Template:WeaponsNav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this navbox template\">e</span></a></span></span><div class=\"navbox-title-pad navbox-title-padleft navbox-title-padright\"><a href=\"/w/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapons</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\"><a href=\"/w/Axes\" title=\"Axes\">Axes</a></th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><pre class=\"navbox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#91;&#34;Category:Navbox orphans&#34;,&#34;Primal Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Thundering Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Bleeding Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Early Axes&#34;,&#34;Thunderblood Greataxe&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Greataxe&#34;,&#34;Nord Greataxe&#34;,&#34;Skull Splittur&#34;,&#34;Black Metal Battleaxe&#34;,&#34;Crystal Battleaxe&#34;,&#34;Battleaxe&#34;,&#34;Thunderblood Axe&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Axe&#34;,&#34;Nord Axe&#34;,&#34;Jotun Bane&#34;,&#34;Black Metal Axe&#34;,&#34;Iron Axe&#34;,&#34;Bronze Axe&#34;,&#34;Flint Axe&#34;,&#34;Stone Axe&#34;&#93;</pre><div class=\"hlist\"></div><table class=\"navbox-subgroup\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">One-handed</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><pre class=\"navbox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#91;&#34;Thunderblood Axe&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Axe&#34;,&#34;Nord Axe&#34;,&#34;Jotun Bane&#34;,&#34;Black Metal Axe&#34;,&#34;Iron Axe&#34;,&#34;Bronze Axe&#34;,&#34;Flint Axe&#34;,&#34;Stone Axe&#34;&#93;</pre><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/w/Stone_Axe\" title=\"Stone Axe\">Stone Axe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Flint_Axe\" title=\"Flint Axe\">Flint Axe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Bronze_Axe\" title=\"Bronze Axe\">Bronze Axe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Iron_Axe\" title=\"Iron Axe\">Iron Axe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Black_Metal_Axe\" title=\"Black Metal Axe\">Black Metal Axe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Jotun_Bane\" title=\"Jotun Bane\">Jotun Bane</a> • <a href=\"/w/Nord_Axe\" title=\"Nord Axe\">Nord Axe</a> (<a href=\"/w/Frostfire_Axe\" title=\"Frostfire Axe\">Frostfire</a> • <a href=\"/w/Thunderblood_Axe\" title=\"Thunderblood Axe\">Thunderblood</a>)</div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row alt\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Two-handed</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><pre class=\"navbox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#91;&#34;Thunderblood Greataxe&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Greataxe&#34;,&#34;Nord Greataxe&#34;,&#34;Skull Splittur&#34;,&#34;Black Metal Battleaxe&#34;,&#34;Crystal Battleaxe&#34;,&#34;Battleaxe&#34;&#93;</pre><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/w/Battleaxe\" title=\"Battleaxe\">Battleaxe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Crystal_Battleaxe\" title=\"Crystal Battleaxe\">Crystal Battleaxe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Black_Metal_Battleaxe\" title=\"Black Metal Battleaxe\">Black Metal Battleaxe</a> • <a href=\"/w/Skull_Splittur\" title=\"Skull Splittur\">Skull Splittur</a> • <a href=\"/w/Nord_Greataxe\" title=\"Nord Greataxe\">Nord Greataxe</a> (<a href=\"/w/Frostfire_Greataxe\" title=\"Frostfire Greataxe\">Frostfire</a> • <a href=\"/w/Thunderblood_Greataxe\" title=\"Thunderblood Greataxe\">Thunderblood</a>)</div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Dual wielded</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><pre class=\"navbox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#91;&#34;Primal Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Thundering Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Bleeding Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Berserkir Axes&#34;,&#34;Early Axes&#34;&#93;</pre><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/w/Early_Axes\" title=\"Early Axes\">Early Axes</a> • <a href=\"/w/Berserkir_Axes\" title=\"Berserkir Axes\">Berserkir Axes</a> (<a href=\"/w/Bleeding_Berserkir_Axes\" title=\"Bleeding Berserkir Axes\">Bleeding Berserkir Axes</a> • <a href=\"/w/Thundering_Berserkir_Axes\" title=\"Thundering Berserkir Axes\">Thundering Berserkir Axes</a> • <a href=\"/w/Primal_Berserkir_Axes\" title=\"Primal Berserkir Axes\">Primal Berserkir Axes</a>)</div></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"hlist\"></div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row alt\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\"><a href=\"/w/Clubs\" title=\"Clubs\">Clubs</a></th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><pre class=\"navbox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#91;&#34;Category:Navbox orphans&#34;,&#34;Thunderblood Sledge&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Sledge&#34;,&#34;Nord Sledge&#34;,&#34;Demolisher&#34;,&#34;Iron Sledge&#34;,&#34;Stagbreaker&#34;,&#34;Thunderblood Mace&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Mace&#34;,&#34;Nord Mace&#34;,&#34;Klossen&#34;,&#34;Storm Star&#34;,&#34;Bloodgeon&#34;,&#34;Flametal Mace&#34;,&#34;Porcupine&#34;,&#34;Frostner&#34;,&#34;Iron Mace&#34;,&#34;Bronze Mace&#34;,&#34;Club&#34;,&#34;Torch&#34;&#93;</pre><div class=\"hlist\"></div><table class=\"navbox-subgroup\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-row alt\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">One-handed</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><pre class=\"navbox-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\">&#91;&#34;Thunderblood Mace&#34;,&#34;Frostfire Mace&#34;,&#34;Nord Mace&#34;,&#34;Klossen&#34;,&#34;Storm Star&#34;,&#34;Bloodgeon&#34;,&#34;Flametal Mace&#34;,&#34;Porcupine&#34;,&#34;Frostner&#34;,&#34;Iron Mace&#34;,&#34;Bronze Mace&#34;,&#34;Club&#34;,&#34;Torch&#34;&#93;</pre><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/w/Torch\" title=\"Torch\">Torch</a> • <a href=\"/w/Club\" title=\"Club\">Club</a> • <a href=\"/w/Bronze_Mace\" title=\"Bronze Mace\">Bronze Mace</a> • <a href=\"/w/Iron_Mace\" title=\"Iron Mace\">Iron Mace</a> • <a href=\"/w/Frostner\" title=\"Frostner\">Frostner</a> • <a href=\"/w/Porcupine\" title=\"Porcupine\">Porcupine</a>